  "duration_s": 449.041667,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "一九七三年，中科院收到一封从英国寄来的信，写信的是英国著名数学家哈布斯坦。信里有一句话，你们中国有个叫陈景润的，他把古老的筛发推到了人类智力的极限。这一年，陈景润四十岁，他在那间六平米的厕所改的小屋里，用挤麻袋草稿纸证明了那一加二哥德巴赫猜想。研究领域全世界公认的最高峰。后来这项成果被命名为陈氏定理。五十多年过去了，全世界没有一个人能再往前挪一步。可你知道吗？一九七三年的时候，绝大多数中国人根本不知道陈景润是谁，他的论文全是公式，只有少数数学家看得懂，他苦熬了半辈子，为国争光，世纪就那么静静，躺了五年，没人宣传，没人知道。直到一九七八年，作家徐迟写了篇报告文学叫哥德巴赫猜想。这篇文章不写公式，只写人写他住六平米小屋，写他用废报纸打草稿，写他咳着写演算，且他不求名利。人民日报、光明日报破例用三个整版转载。一夜之间，陈景润的名字传遍了大江南北。千千万万普通人第一次知道，原来咱们中国有这么一位科学家、工人、农民、学生也许看不懂数学，但所有人都看懂了两个字。坚守信件，像雪片一样飞进中科院麻袋，堆满了办公室，邓小平同志专门接见了他。看着这个销售腼腆的男人说了一句，中国如果有一千个陈景润，国家就了不得。可这个在数学世界里无所不能的天才，在生活里连自己都照顾不好。一九七七年，四十五岁的陈景润因病住进三零九医院，照顾他的是个二十七岁的女军医叫尤坤，一个是梦葫芦式的数学怪才，一个是开朗的年轻姑娘，差了十八岁，可由鲲发现这个别人眼里不通人情的人心比谁都软，比谁都真。一九八零年，他们结婚了。第二年，儿子陈有伟出生，这个孤独了大半辈子的人终于有了个家，可他的身体早就被几十年的高强度，用脑掏空了。一九七九年，他去美国普林斯顿高等研究院做交流，国外给的条件，顶级薪资优厚，他照样省吃俭用。五个月后回国，他把所有酬劳七千五百美元一分没留，全上交了国家。他说，国家还不富裕，我不能私留行李箱打开，没有一件洋货，没有一样纪念品，满满一箱子全是他手写的演算手稿。一九八四年，一场车祸诱发了严重的帕金森综合征。从此，他双手不停发抖，再也握不住钢笔写不了字，他就口述，让家人记拼着。最后一口气也要在数学的路上多走一步。他这辈子有两个遗憾，一个是没能证明哥德巴赫猜想的最终答案，一加一，他离那最后一步就差那么一点点。另一个是没来得及陪儿子长大。一九九六年三月十九日，六十三岁的陈景润走了。临走前，他做了个决定，把遗体捐给医院，供医学解剖，为国家在做最后一点贡献。他走后，家人收拾遗物，翻出一张泛黄的纸。当年北京四中的解票信通知纸的背面密密麻麻写满了他随手推演的公式。这张薄纸就是他一辈子不认命的证据，还有件事很多人误会了几十年。有人说，陈景润的成果够拿菲尔兹奖，是西方故意不给他，真不是菲尔兹奖。有个死规矩颁奖那年一月一日之前必须未满四十岁陈景润一九三三年五月出生，一九七四年颁奖时，他已经过了四十岁七个月，规则上就没资格了。不是偏见，是遗憾。一个拿命做数学的人，最后输给了年龄。他的儿子陈有伟小时候对数学没兴趣，去国外读了商科，长大以后慢慢读懂了父亲。后来主动转工，数学结过了父亲没跑完的接力棒，陈景润的一生，六十三年，清贫孤独，隐忍死磕。他被人笑过，被人辞退过，被人遗忘过，可他从来没放下过手里的笔，他用几麻袋草稿纸告诉全世界中国人敢啃最硬的骨头敢登最高的山。如今日子好了，很多人只记得他古怪的样子，却忘了他熬过的那些冬夜，咳出的那些血守过的那些孤独，但伤何忌得岁月。记得祖国，记得清贫，筑风谷，孤灯照山河，致敬陈景润，致敬每一个在黑暗里默默攀登的人。如果你也被感动了，点亮红心评论区打一句致敬先辈转发出去，让更多人看到这些不该被遗忘的名字，关注我，持续分享真实的为人往事。说实话，写陈景润的时候，我翻了很多资料，越翻越难受。他住六平米小屋，用起麻袋草稿纸算出了陈氏定理。可像他这样的人，还有四十多位，很多人连名字都没听过。这套国之激烈，把他们的故事全写进去了。钱学森、邓稼先、郭永怀、袁隆平，一个一个全是我们这个民族的顶梁柱，不是干巴巴的。人物简介是真写，他们怎么吃苦，怎么咬牙怎么把命豁出去自己看长骨气给孩子看立大志，这些名字不能忘，不该忘。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00001",
      "start_ms": 90,
      "end_ms": 1170,
      "text": "一九七三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1470,
      "end_ms": 4290,
      "text": "中科院收到一封从英国寄来的信，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4990,
      "end_ms": 8590,
      "text": "写信的是英国著名数学家哈布斯坦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00004",
      "start_ms": 9070,
      "end_ms": 10210,
      "text": "信里有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10570,
      "end_ms": 13030,
      "text": "你们中国有个叫陈景润的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13570,
      "end_ms": 18110,
      "text": "他把古老的筛发推到了人类智力的极限。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00007",
      "start_ms": 19010,
      "end_ms": 19670,
      "text": "这一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20410,
      "end_ms": 22130,
      "text": "陈景润四十岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00009",
      "start_ms": 23030,
      "end_ms": 26610,
      "text": "他在那间六平米的厕所改的小屋里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00010",
      "start_ms": 26990,
      "end_ms": 32020,
      "text": "用挤麻袋草稿纸证明了那一加二哥德巴赫猜想。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00011",
      "start_ms": 32080,
      "end_ms": 35800,
      "text": "研究领域全世界公认的最高峰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00012",
      "start_ms": 36700,
      "end_ms": 41360,
      "text": "后来这项成果被命名为陈氏定理。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00013",
      "start_ms": 41460,
      "end_ms": 42800,
      "text": "五十多年过去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00014",
      "start_ms": 43380,
      "end_ms": 46980,
      "text": "全世界没有一个人能再往前挪一步。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00015",
      "start_ms": 47860,
      "end_ms": 48780,
      "text": "可你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00016",
      "start_ms": 49620,
      "end_ms": 51300,
      "text": "一九七三年的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00017",
      "start_ms": 52240,
      "end_ms": 55780,
      "text": "绝大多数中国人根本不知道陈景润是谁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00018",
      "start_ms": 56300,
      "end_ms": 58060,
      "text": "他的论文全是公式，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00019",
      "start_ms": 58480,
      "end_ms": 60585,
      "text": "只有少数数学家看得懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00020",
      "start_ms": 61070,
      "end_ms": 62690,
      "text": "他苦熬了半辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00021",
      "start_ms": 62690,
      "end_ms": 63635,
      "text": "为国争光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00022",
      "start_ms": 64090,
      "end_ms": 65610,
      "text": "世纪就那么静静，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00023",
      "start_ms": 65610,
      "end_ms": 66445,
      "text": "躺了五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00024",
      "start_ms": 67020,
      "end_ms": 67960,
      "text": "没人宣传，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00025",
      "start_ms": 68220,
      "end_ms": 69145,
      "text": "没人知道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00026",
      "start_ms": 69590,
      "end_ms": 70830,
      "text": "直到一九七八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00027",
      "start_ms": 71070,
      "end_ms": 75635,
      "text": "作家徐迟写了篇报告文学叫哥德巴赫猜想。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00028",
      "start_ms": 75920,
      "end_ms": 77280,
      "text": "这篇文章不写公式，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00029",
      "start_ms": 77380,
      "end_ms": 80235,
      "text": "只写人写他住六平米小屋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00030",
      "start_ms": 80670,
      "end_ms": 82735,
      "text": "写他用废报纸打草稿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00031",
      "start_ms": 83150,
      "end_ms": 84845,
      "text": "写他咳着写演算，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00032",
      "start_ms": 85200,
      "end_ms": 86375,
      "text": "且他不求名利。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00033",
      "start_ms": 86890,
      "end_ms": 91355,
      "text": "人民日报、光明日报破例用三个整版转载。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00034",
      "start_ms": 91840,
      "end_ms": 92705,
      "text": "一夜之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00035",
      "start_ms": 93080,
      "end_ms": 96395,
      "text": "陈景润的名字传遍了大江南北。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00036",
      "start_ms": 97020,
      "end_ms": 99765,
      "text": "千千万万普通人第一次知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00037",
      "start_ms": 100550,
      "end_ms": 107600,
      "text": "原来咱们中国有这么一位科学家、工人、农民、学生也许看不懂数学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00038",
      "start_ms": 107900,
      "end_ms": 109840,
      "text": "但所有人都看懂了两个字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00039",
      "start_ms": 110160,
      "end_ms": 111395,
      "text": "坚守信件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00040",
      "start_ms": 111870,
      "end_ms": 114870,
      "text": "像雪片一样飞进中科院麻袋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00041",
      "start_ms": 114930,
      "end_ms": 116205,
      "text": "堆满了办公室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00042",
      "start_ms": 116900,
      "end_ms": 119105,
      "text": "邓小平同志专门接见了他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00043",
      "start_ms": 119570,
      "end_ms": 123505,
      "text": "看着这个销售腼腆的男人说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00044",
      "start_ms": 124190,
      "end_ms": 126955,
      "text": "中国如果有一千个陈景润，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00045",
      "start_ms": 127410,
      "end_ms": 128535,
      "text": "国家就了不得。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00046",
      "start_ms": 129100,
      "end_ms": 132120,
      "text": "可这个在数学世界里无所不能的天才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00047",
      "start_ms": 132600,
      "end_ms": 135695,
      "text": "在生活里连自己都照顾不好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00048",
      "start_ms": 136550,
      "end_ms": 137630,
      "text": "一九七七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00049",
      "start_ms": 137870,
      "end_ms": 142215,
      "text": "四十五岁的陈景润因病住进三零九医院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00050",
      "start_ms": 142730,
      "end_ms": 146955,
      "text": "照顾他的是个二十七岁的女军医叫尤坤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00051",
      "start_ms": 147560,
      "end_ms": 149955,
      "text": "一个是梦葫芦式的数学怪才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00052",
      "start_ms": 150330,
      "end_ms": 152290,
      "text": "一个是开朗的年轻姑娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00053",
      "start_ms": 152390,
      "end_ms": 153495,
      "text": "差了十八岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00054",
      "start_ms": 153970,
      "end_ms": 159460,
      "text": "可由鲲发现这个别人眼里不通人情的人心比谁都软，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00055",
      "start_ms": 159660,
      "end_ms": 160645,
      "text": "比谁都真。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00056",
      "start_ms": 161640,
      "end_ms": 162820,
      "text": "一九八零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00057",
      "start_ms": 162960,
      "end_ms": 163975,
      "text": "他们结婚了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00058",
      "start_ms": 165180,
      "end_ms": 165905,
      "text": "第二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00059",
      "start_ms": 167300,
      "end_ms": 169045,
      "text": "儿子陈有伟出生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00060",
      "start_ms": 169590,
      "end_ms": 173245,
      "text": "这个孤独了大半辈子的人终于有了个家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00061",
      "start_ms": 173930,
      "end_ms": 177470,
      "text": "可他的身体早就被几十年的高强度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00062",
      "start_ms": 177630,
      "end_ms": 178795,
      "text": "用脑掏空了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00063",
      "start_ms": 179620,
      "end_ms": 180680,
      "text": "一九七九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00064",
      "start_ms": 180880,
      "end_ms": 184395,
      "text": "他去美国普林斯顿高等研究院做交流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00065",
      "start_ms": 185060,
      "end_ms": 186180,
      "text": "国外给的条件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00066",
      "start_ms": 186180,
      "end_ms": 188285,
      "text": "顶级薪资优厚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00067",
      "start_ms": 188660,
      "end_ms": 190585,
      "text": "他照样省吃俭用。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00068",
      "start_ms": 190810,
      "end_ms": 191965,
      "text": "五个月后回国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00069",
      "start_ms": 192490,
      "end_ms": 196415,
      "text": "他把所有酬劳七千五百美元一分没留，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00070",
      "start_ms": 196910,
      "end_ms": 198125,
      "text": "全上交了国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00071",
      "start_ms": 198670,
      "end_ms": 199050,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00072",
      "start_ms": 199310,
      "end_ms": 200455,
      "text": "国家还不富裕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00073",
      "start_ms": 200750,
      "end_ms": 203255,
      "text": "我不能私留行李箱打开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00074",
      "start_ms": 203710,
      "end_ms": 205055,
      "text": "没有一件洋货，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00075",
      "start_ms": 205380,
      "end_ms": 206705,
      "text": "没有一样纪念品，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00076",
      "start_ms": 207030,
      "end_ms": 210585,
      "text": "满满一箱子全是他手写的演算手稿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00077",
      "start_ms": 211470,
      "end_ms": 212455,
      "text": "一九八四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00078",
      "start_ms": 212690,
      "end_ms": 216835,
      "text": "一场车祸诱发了严重的帕金森综合征。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00079",
      "start_ms": 217420,
      "end_ms": 217880,
      "text": "从此，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00080",
      "start_ms": 217880,
      "end_ms": 219485,
      "text": "他双手不停发抖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00081",
      "start_ms": 219870,
      "end_ms": 222205,
      "text": "再也握不住钢笔写不了字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00082",
      "start_ms": 222540,
      "end_ms": 223495,
      "text": "他就口述，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00083",
      "start_ms": 223890,
      "end_ms": 226040,
      "text": "让家人记拼着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00084",
      "start_ms": 226040,
      "end_ms": 229315,
      "text": "最后一口气也要在数学的路上多走一步。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00085",
      "start_ms": 230090,
      "end_ms": 231835,
      "text": "他这辈子有两个遗憾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00086",
      "start_ms": 232820,
      "end_ms": 237705,
      "text": "一个是没能证明哥德巴赫猜想的最终答案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00087",
      "start_ms": 238560,
      "end_ms": 239415,
      "text": "一加一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00088",
      "start_ms": 240190,
      "end_ms": 243390,
      "text": "他离那最后一步就差那么一点点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00089",
      "start_ms": 244010,
      "end_ms": 247110,
      "text": "另一个是没来得及陪儿子长大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00090",
      "start_ms": 248129,
      "end_ms": 250150,
      "text": "一九九六年三月十九日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00091",
      "start_ms": 250670,
      "end_ms": 252790,
      "text": "六十三岁的陈景润走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00092",
      "start_ms": 253030,
      "end_ms": 253630,
      "text": "临走前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00093",
      "start_ms": 253870,
      "end_ms": 254930,
      "text": "他做了个决定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00094",
      "start_ms": 255330,
      "end_ms": 256970,
      "text": "把遗体捐给医院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00095",
      "start_ms": 257230,
      "end_ms": 258470,
      "text": "供医学解剖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00096",
      "start_ms": 258930,
      "end_ms": 261290,
      "text": "为国家在做最后一点贡献。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00097",
      "start_ms": 262210,
      "end_ms": 262890,
      "text": "他走后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00098",
      "start_ms": 263650,
      "end_ms": 264990,
      "text": "家人收拾遗物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00099",
      "start_ms": 265110,
      "end_ms": 266850,
      "text": "翻出一张泛黄的纸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00100",
      "start_ms": 267770,
      "end_ms": 276460,
      "text": "当年北京四中的解票信通知纸的背面密密麻麻写满了他随手推演的公式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00101",
      "start_ms": 277000,
      "end_ms": 280640,
      "text": "这张薄纸就是他一辈子不认命的证据，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00102",
      "start_ms": 281240,
      "end_ms": 284420,
      "text": "还有件事很多人误会了几十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00103",
      "start_ms": 285160,
      "end_ms": 285800,
      "text": "有人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00104",
      "start_ms": 286079,
      "end_ms": 288660,
      "text": "陈景润的成果够拿菲尔兹奖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00105",
      "start_ms": 288880,
      "end_ms": 290460,
      "text": "是西方故意不给他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00106",
      "start_ms": 291600,
      "end_ms": 294280,
      "text": "真不是菲尔兹奖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00107",
      "start_ms": 294400,
      "end_ms": 303410,
      "text": "有个死规矩颁奖那年一月一日之前必须未满四十岁陈景润一九三三年五月出生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00108",
      "start_ms": 303510,
      "end_ms": 305390,
      "text": "一九七四年颁奖时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00109",
      "start_ms": 305750,
      "end_ms": 308190,
      "text": "他已经过了四十岁七个月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00110",
      "start_ms": 308930,
      "end_ms": 310530,
      "text": "规则上就没资格了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00111",
      "start_ms": 311250,
      "end_ms": 312270,
      "text": "不是偏见，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00112",
      "start_ms": 312470,
      "end_ms": 313230,
      "text": "是遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00113",
      "start_ms": 314090,
      "end_ms": 316210,
      "text": "一个拿命做数学的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00114",
      "start_ms": 316550,
      "end_ms": 318370,
      "text": "最后输给了年龄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00115",
      "start_ms": 318970,
      "end_ms": 322490,
      "text": "他的儿子陈有伟小时候对数学没兴趣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00116",
      "start_ms": 322730,
      "end_ms": 324290,
      "text": "去国外读了商科，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00117",
      "start_ms": 325130,
      "end_ms": 327890,
      "text": "长大以后慢慢读懂了父亲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00118",
      "start_ms": 328250,
      "end_ms": 329810,
      "text": "后来主动转工，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00119",
      "start_ms": 330180,
      "end_ms": 333240,
      "text": "数学结过了父亲没跑完的接力棒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00120",
      "start_ms": 333720,
      "end_ms": 335040,
      "text": "陈景润的一生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00121",
      "start_ms": 335440,
      "end_ms": 336300,
      "text": "六十三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00122",
      "start_ms": 336860,
      "end_ms": 338580,
      "text": "清贫孤独，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00123",
      "start_ms": 338960,
      "end_ms": 340420,
      "text": "隐忍死磕。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00124",
      "start_ms": 340920,
      "end_ms": 342040,
      "text": "他被人笑过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00125",
      "start_ms": 342120,
      "end_ms": 343240,
      "text": "被人辞退过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00126",
      "start_ms": 343400,
      "end_ms": 344500,
      "text": "被人遗忘过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00127",
      "start_ms": 344980,
      "end_ms": 347420,
      "text": "可他从来没放下过手里的笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00128",
      "start_ms": 347880,
      "end_ms": 355620,
      "text": "他用几麻袋草稿纸告诉全世界中国人敢啃最硬的骨头敢登最高的山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00129",
      "start_ms": 356180,
      "end_ms": 357420,
      "text": "如今日子好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00130",
      "start_ms": 357480,
      "end_ms": 359875,
      "text": "很多人只记得他古怪的样子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00131",
      "start_ms": 360530,
      "end_ms": 363025,
      "text": "却忘了他熬过的那些冬夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00132",
      "start_ms": 363470,
      "end_ms": 366265,
      "text": "咳出的那些血守过的那些孤独，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00133",
      "start_ms": 367120,
      "end_ms": 369240,
      "text": "但伤何忌得岁月。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00134",
      "start_ms": 369240,
      "end_ms": 370440,
      "text": "记得祖国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00135",
      "start_ms": 370460,
      "end_ms": 371780,
      "text": "记得清贫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00136",
      "start_ms": 371940,
      "end_ms": 372775,
      "text": "筑风谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00137",
      "start_ms": 373120,
      "end_ms": 374545,
      "text": "孤灯照山河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00138",
      "start_ms": 374960,
      "end_ms": 376325,
      "text": "致敬陈景润，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00139",
      "start_ms": 376900,
      "end_ms": 379815,
      "text": "致敬每一个在黑暗里默默攀登的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00140",
      "start_ms": 380090,
      "end_ms": 381470,
      "text": "如果你也被感动了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00141",
      "start_ms": 381510,
      "end_ms": 386225,
      "text": "点亮红心评论区打一句致敬先辈转发出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00142",
      "start_ms": 386680,
      "end_ms": 390145,
      "text": "让更多人看到这些不该被遗忘的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00143",
      "start_ms": 390770,
      "end_ms": 391415,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00144",
      "start_ms": 391690,
      "end_ms": 394555,
      "text": "持续分享真实的为人往事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00145",
      "start_ms": 394960,
      "end_ms": 395645,
      "text": "说实话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00146",
      "start_ms": 396080,
      "end_ms": 397400,
      "text": "写陈景润的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00147",
      "start_ms": 397600,
      "end_ms": 399035,
      "text": "我翻了很多资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00148",
      "start_ms": 399900,
      "end_ms": 400905,
      "text": "越翻越难受。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00149",
      "start_ms": 401720,
      "end_ms": 403235,
      "text": "他住六平米小屋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00150",
      "start_ms": 403640,
      "end_ms": 406615,
      "text": "用起麻袋草稿纸算出了陈氏定理。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00151",
      "start_ms": 407240,
      "end_ms": 408295,
      "text": "可像他这样的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00152",
      "start_ms": 408800,
      "end_ms": 409875,
      "text": "还有四十多位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00153",
      "start_ms": 410860,
      "end_ms": 413315,
      "text": "很多人连名字都没听过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00154",
      "start_ms": 414520,
      "end_ms": 415820,
      "text": "这套国之激烈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00155",
      "start_ms": 415820,
      "end_ms": 417735,
      "text": "把他们的故事全写进去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00156",
      "start_ms": 418770,
      "end_ms": 422395,
      "text": "钱学森、邓稼先、郭永怀、袁隆平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00157",
      "start_ms": 423300,
      "end_ms": 427415,
      "text": "一个一个全是我们这个民族的顶梁柱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00158",
      "start_ms": 427850,
      "end_ms": 429130,
      "text": "不是干巴巴的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00159",
      "start_ms": 429130,
      "end_ms": 431430,
      "text": "人物简介是真写，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00160",
      "start_ms": 431510,
      "end_ms": 432670,
      "text": "他们怎么吃苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00161",
      "start_ms": 432930,
      "end_ms": 441415,
      "text": "怎么咬牙怎么把命豁出去自己看长骨气给孩子看立大志，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00162",
      "start_ms": 442550,
      "end_ms": 446315,
      "text": "这些名字不能忘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_c6b400f861b51614_s00163",
      "start_ms": 448500,
      "end_ms": 448925,
      "text": "不该忘。"
    }
  ],
